=== ADAPTIVITY / a11y / units (ADR-002/013/014/015) ===
  Adaptive: AutomationActivityFeedScreen reads horizontalSizeClass (iOS) / regular on macOS;
  the gated stats sit trailing on regular (macOS/iPad) and wrap to a second line on compact
  (iPhone); the glass surface is centered + capped to a 720pt readable measure on wide panes.
  Lifecycle: .task { load() } (emits view.opened once), .refreshable { refresh() } (pull-to-
  refresh on both idioms), .onDisappear { stop() }.
  a11y: title carries .isHeader; chip / stats / each live+history row / banner are single
  combined elements with spoken VoiceOver summaries; decorative glyphs .accessibilityHidden;
  Dynamic Type via Font.TS text styles; Reduce Motion honored by the pulse + TSFadeIn/TSSkeleton;
  light/dark via the dynamic Color.TS tokens.
  Units (ADR-014/SI): durations formatted at the display boundary (formatDurationMs port); no
  non-SI value stored/computed. Strings via String(localized:) / LocalizedStringKey (ADR-014),
  web key names preserved.

